# Review requests for agent, AI and CI configuration.
#
# These entries auto-request a review on the paths that decide what automation
# does: agent instructions, skills and agents for Copilot and Claude, the APM
# skill manifest and lockfile, and workflows. Dependabot's APM update PRs land
# here too, so they always ask for a human look.
#
# This file is deliberately ADVISORY. Do not enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" in branch protection: with a single owner it would block that owner's
# own pull requests, because an author never satisfies their own code-owner
# review. What actually gates these paths is
# .github/workflows/guard-agent-config.yml (the `agent-config-approved` label).

/AGENTS.md          @rajbos
/apm.yml            @rajbos
/apm.lock.yaml      @rajbos
/.claude/           @rajbos
/.agents/           @rajbos
/.github/           @rajbos
